            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An interface (402, 502, 602, 1202) with improved accessibility is provided. The interface (402 502, 602, 1202) includes a housing (430, 530, 630, 1230) and a meter electronics (520, 620, 1220) disposed inside the housing (430, 530, 630, 1230). The meter electronics (420, 520, 620, 1220) is configured to affix to a connector (450, 550, 650, 1250) extending into the housing (430, 530, 630, 1230). Other aspects are also provided.</p>
            </abstract>
